n fatally wounded by the  syringes the scary beasts with tails one  of them attacks munsu but he quickly  takes out his gun and shoots it our  protagonist has two guns and is ready to  bring every sarina down  munsu convinces these ugly beasts to  spare his life and in exchange he hands  them over mont's corpse the beast agree  and begin enjoying their feast wait  there's a catch there's a bomb planted  inside the boy's corpse that blows the  hell out of these creatures and boom  they're all dead we see a headband  flying and landing in front of munsu's  feet and he decides to wear it the boy's  bat now accompanies munsu who thinks  he's responsible for the boy's death and  he decides to take up his mission and  save his girlfriend  at the new leader's fortress a giant guy  is squishing people to death and the  leader is enjoying the sight if one of  the villagers managed to kill the giant  they will be released but the leader  goes against his words and banishes  their family to die in the desert's heat  one of the court men informs the lord  that chun tried to harm her and he  decides to see her the girl is chained  and tied to the wall the lord tells it  that no arminosa is coming for her  rescue and that she must surrender and  start her life with him the lord is  looking for mercenary to protect himself  he's informed that one mercery has come  forward and he was asked to defeat 100  men at the same time as a test and so  the test begins and the mercenary has to  defeat all of the commoners the  mercenary reveals himself and it's munsu  the armanosa who's come to take down the  lord's army and eliminate his empire  munsu pushes the commoners and tells  them he's not here to save them once who  takes off his mask and uses the  medallion to unleash his powers and  summon an army of phantom soldiers to  destroy the lord's army while unleashing  his powers the army also make it clear  that nothing like this will happen for  the villagers again because clearly he's 