 were  resurrected the doctor arrives and tells  that he didn't do this for his own glory  he instead wanted to use his powers to  save those who had fallen into despair  he wanted to ease the boy's pain june  tells him that even when every one of  his wishes was fulfilled when the doctor  arrived to the island he always had  doubts the doctor becomes angry and  summons the spirits of the dead to make  him taste the agony of the reality  the doctor says he could have turned  this place into a paradise but instead  he decided to turn against him and  everyone he loved hence rising his wrath  munsu uses his medallion to unleash the  phantom soldiers and orders them to take  these spirits and deliver them to  purgatory and decides to take on the  dock all by himself marie and sando face  each other and the battle begins the two  give each other a tough sword fight  meanwhile the doctor tells munsu about  mandrake needle that will make him live  for eternity but he turns down the offer  munsu decides to take the doctor down  with his only one weapon meanwhile sando  manages to defeat marie with her sword  skills the doctor throws thunder at  munsu who ends up dropping his weapon he  grabs him by the neck and asks him why  he provoked him despite knowing he's  powerful mutsu responds by saying he  never played by the rules he takes out  his hidden gun and shoots the doctor in  the head but the dock is still alive  fortunately sando arrives at the spot  and beheads the doctor when the dog  started to regenerate munsu steps on his  head and takes out another hidden weapon  to shoot him but shoots his body instead  because if the doctor doesn't have a  body he wouldn't be able to return  before dying the doc asks him who was  the man munsumas took him for it was  ajit day he's the reason munsu refuses  to die he wishes to track him down and  kill him but that's for another story  joon realizes that he didn't survive the  epidemic either he takes out the gun  ones who gave him happily returning to  heaven  rest in peace june come so this is it  for today's video if you liked the video  give it a huge thumbs up and subscribe  to the channel for more videos farewell  till next time

